<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>三因制宜 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%89%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%B6%E5%AE%9C/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 10:33:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%89%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%B6%E5%AE%9C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>六元正纪大论篇第七十一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-71/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-71/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>系统阐述了五运六气的周期规律、气候物候对应关系及疾病防治原则，强调“天人相应”的动态平衡观，为中医时间医学与气候医学的奠基理论。</description></item><item><title>五常政大论篇第七十</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-70/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-70/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文详细阐述了五行与阴阳气候变化对人体健康、寿命及疾病的影响，提出了不同气候条件下的生理特征、病理表现及治疗方法，强调了天时、地利与气候变化对生命的深远影响。</description></item><item><title>异法方宜论篇第十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-12/</link><pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-12/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文通过黄帝与岐伯的对话，系统阐述了中医&amp;quot;因地制宜&amp;quot;的治疗原则，详细分析了东、西、南、北、中五方地域环境、饮食习惯对居民体质和疾病特征的影响，并指出相应适宜的治疗方法（如东方用针灸、西方用毒药、北方用艾灸、南方用九针、中央用导引按蹻），强调高明医者应当&amp;quot;杂合以治&amp;quot;，根据患者的具体情况选择最适合的治疗手段。</description></item></channel></rss>